# Keep every text file LF in the working tree and in the repository.
#
# This plugin ships a hand-written browser bundle (`client.js`) that DSH reads
# byte for byte. Git's autocrlf would rewrite its line endings on checkout and
# the file would no longer be the one that was tested.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.tgz binary
